## Publish gate — track + lesson links (fail-closed)

When a unit deck ships (`docs/tracks/en/uem/2627-ct/u-N-*/index.html` + `data/content.json`), **all** of the following are mandatory before the unit may leave `pending forge`:

1. **Track Units table** (`docs/tracks/en/creativity-techniques/index.md`) — Status cell is exactly the pattern  
   `**pilot** — [lesson]({{ '/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/<slug>/' | relative_url }}) · [deck]({{ '/tracks/ct/<slug>/' | relative_url }})`  
   Both anchors must resolve. Pending units stay text-only (`pending forge`) — never invent a deck URL.
2. **Lesson frontmatter** — `deck_url: /tracks/ct/<slug>/`
3. **Lesson cover** — a real Markdown link, not bare text:  
   `**In-class deck:** [UN student slideshow]({{ '/tracks/ct/<slug>/' | relative_url }})`  
   Example (U1): [In-class deck on the live lesson](https://ruvebal.github.io/creativity-techniques-uem/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/u-1-introduction-creativity/) must render `U1 student slideshow` as an `<a href="…/tracks/ct/u-1-introduction-creativity/">`.
4. **How to Pass** rhythm line on the same cover (Analysis → Masterclass → Lab → Workshop).

These two student surfaces (track table + lesson-head deck link) are forge law — same gate as Digital Creativity `STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE` publish gate. Cold review fails the unit if either is missing or not an `<a>`.

## Implementation notes

- Structural slides (`analysis_opener`, `lab_opener`, `workshop_opener`, `outro`) use `fractal-pass-track` SVGs only.
- Masterclass diagram fallback: **Koch triangle** via `scripts/fractal-architecture/generate-koch-triangle.mjs` — do not use Sierpinski for deck Masterclass.
- Images: **`npm run media:rehydrate`** (worktree only, never on `main`) binds each v2 slide's `asset_id` if it is accepted in Profield `review-state.json` (`project_id` + `unit_id`, read only) or in `excellence/curation/autopilot-assets.json`; URLs come from `media-index*.json`; renditions go to `deck-media/`; orphan cache files are deleted. Legacy decks are skipped. `npm run build` runs `validate-decks.mjs --strict --rights=flag`. Do not hard-code another unit’s sample images into a deck.
- Public captions: title · credit · licence · source link. **Never** `resource_uuid`, `forger_version`, or review tags in square brackets.
- Logo: transparent chrome — no card behind institutional logo.
- Publication firewall: no studio infra names in rendered HTML.
- Final event theme (TC): **What is creativity for you?**
- Student lessons hub must state Analysis → Masterclass → Lab → Workshop: `docs/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/index.md`.
